            "sid": "NUM 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Mose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Waamuru Waisraeli ukisema: Mtakapoingia Kanaani, nchi ambayo ninawapa iwe nchi yenu, mipaka ya eneo lenu lote itakuwa kama ifuatavyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Upande wa kusini mpaka wenu utakuwa kutoka jangwa la Sini kupitia upande wa Edomu. Utaanzia mashariki upande wa kusini mwisho wa Bahari ya Chumvi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha utapinda kusini kuelekea pito la Akrabimu na kupitia Sini hadi Kadesh-barnea, upande wa kusini. Kutoka hapo, mpaka utapinda kuelekea kaskazini-magharibi hadi Hasar-adari na kupita hadi Azmoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Azmoni utapinda kuelekea kijito cha Misri kwenye mpaka wa Misri na kuishia bahari ya Mediteranea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mpaka wenu wa upande wa magharibi utakuwa bahari ya Mediteranea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mpaka wenu wa upande wa kaskazini utakuwa kama ifuatavyo: Kutoka bahari ya Mediteranea, mtatia alama hadi Mlima Hori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Mlima Hori mtatia alama hadi pito la Hamathi, na kuendelea hadi Sedadi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kupita hadi Zifroni na kuishia Hazar-enani; huo utakuwa mpaka wenu wa kaskazini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mpaka wenu wa upande wa mashariki mtauweka kutoka Hazar-enani hadi Shefamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka Shefamu utaelekea kusini hadi Ribla, mashariki mwa Aini; kisha mpaka huo utakwenda chini hadi mteremko wa mashariki wa ziwa Kinerethi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kinerethi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ziwa Galilaya.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "halafu utateremka kufuata mto Yordani hadi Bahari ya Chumvi; hii ndiyo itakuwa nchi yako kama mpaka ulivyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
