        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Yosh 14:1-5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Basi, Mose akawaambia Waisraeli, “Hii ndiyo nchi mtakayoirithi kwa kupiga kura, nchi ambayo Mwenyezi-Mungu ameagiza yapewe makabila tisa na nusu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabila la Reubeni na la Gadi, na nusu ya kabila la Manase yamepata urithi wao kulingana na koo zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makabila hayo mawili na nusu yamepata urithi wao ngambo ya mto Yordani upande wa mashariki, mkabala wa Yeriko, mawioni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
